            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Pure Chocho has 8 g of carbohydrate, all of it fiber, per the label, so it has essentially zero net carbs and suits keto; flavored bags add 1 to 2 g of sugar. Pure Chocho is Monash University Low FODMAP Certified, per Mikuna, but the Vanilla, Cacao and Horchata versions are not. Check with a dietitian if you follow a medical diet."
