            Beyond the lab reports, Mikuna lists brand-level certifications that it says apply to Pure Chocho: Certified B Corporation, Non-GMO Project Verified, Certified Vegan, OU Kosher and Monash University Low FODMAP Certified. The chocho itself is not sold as USDA Organic, although the flavoring ingredients in Vanilla and Cacao are labeled organic. If you want to compare Mikuna's lead numbers with other brands, our <a href="/best-protein-powder-without-heavy-metals/">guide to protein powders without heavy metals</a> covers the brands that publish theirs.
