          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Mikuna Chocho Plant Protein is the most transparent plant protein we have looked at and one of the most expensive. Every bag gives 20 g of complete protein and 8 to 9 g of fiber from a whole Andean lupin bean, Pure Chocho has a single ingredient and a low FODMAP certification, and Mikuna publishes Eurofins reports showing trace lead and no detected PFAS or pesticides. The trade-offs are 190 to 210 calories per serving, a lupin allergy risk and about $3.67 per 25 g of protein.
